  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">ara::core::Result</a>&lt; void &gt; ConfigureMonitor (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_diag_ara_diag_fbd60d.html#SWS_DM_01701\">MonitorHandleType</a> monitor Handle, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_diag_ara_diag_fbd60d.html#SWS_DM_02121\">InitMonitorNotifier</a> initMonitor, <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::function</a>&lt; <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/integer\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::int8_t</a>()&gt; getFaultDetectionCounter) noexcept;</pre>",
